# 🧠 What Did We Learn?

| ✅ Good Practice                            | ❌ What Went Wrong                                   |
| ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| Store only a **session ID** in cookies     | The actual secret was stored in the cookie          |
| Keep sensitive information **server-side** | The flag was placed in client-side storage          |
| Use appropriate cookie security attributes | Sensitive information was directly readable         |
| Treat all client-side data as untrusted    | The application trusted data controlled by the user |

